      ],
      "source": "https://losthistory.net/nynjctbotany/njnbtofc/montgomerytwn.html",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Early mills powered by Rock Brook, Rocky Hill, Pike Brook and Bedens Brook dotted the township’s landscape in the 18th and 19th centuries.",
